#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="1533836977" tvg-name="François Ozon navigates diverse genres‚ from tragedies to popular comedies and enigmatic tales. With curiosity and a playful approach‚ he deciphers the unknowns of life through his films‚ crafting stories that reveal his unique cinematic voice.<br/>From 09.12.2024 10:43" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",In Conversation with François Ozon (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.12.2024)
