#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="456322752" tvg-name="Michael Haneke retraces his career and talks about the first films he made for television‚ but also how they differ from his later films intended for a cinema audience.<br/>From 02.12.2024 09:58" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",In Conversation with Michael Haneke (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.12.2024)
