#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="1712333902" tvg-name="Before becoming a filmmaker‚ Robert Guédiguian always thought he would be an activist who lived intensely. His cinema is like him: From Marseille‚ expansive and joyful‚ poetic and above all‚ human.<br/>From 15.03.2024 18:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Conversation with Robert Guédiguian (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (15.03.2024)
