#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="109106388" tvg-name="Walter Salles‚ a former documentary filmmaker‚ is deeply inspired by Brazil’s history. His films vividly depict the country’s social and political realities‚ intertwining past and present. Central to his storytelling are the perspectives of people in a society shaped by the absence of fathers‚ both figuratively and literally – offering a poignant view of Brazilian identity.<br/>From 29.01.2025 11:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",A Conversation with Walter Salles (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (29.01.2025)
