#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="1202963054" tvg-name="For Rebecca Zlotowski‚ being a filmmaker today is all about taking an intimate look at the world. As a screenwriter and director‚ she makes films by infusing her personal obsessions with major social movements. Zlotowski’s work is imbued with poetry‚ charm and a paradoxical mystery between a pragmatic and mysterious view of life.<br/>From 06.12.2024 12:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",A Conversation with Rebecca Zlotowski (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (06.12.2024)
