#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="970693349" tvg-name="In a shadowy world where luck is real and transferable‚ Federico seeks revenge against the man who once stole everything from him. He discovers Tomás‚ a young thief and sole survivor of a plane crash‚ and sees in him the power to challenge fate itself. As the two descend into an underground network of high-stakes games‚ they risk everything to outplay destiny.<br/>From 27.08.2025 13:05" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Intacto (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (27.08.2025)
