#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="2002215325" tvg-name="In a threadbare rehearsal space‚ a Spanish flamenco troupe gathers to stage Federico Garcia Lorca's play “Blood Wedding”. Through striking choreography and music‚ they evoke a story of forbidden passion‚ betrayal and revenge. A haunting meditation on ritual and the emotional power of dance.<br/>From 27.08.2025 15:38" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Blood Wedding (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (27.08.2025)
