#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="2142176913" tvg-name="During World War II‚ Julien‚ a quiet French surgeon‚ sends his wife and daughter to safety‚ or so he thinks. When he discovers the SS has massacred them‚ his grief turns to vengeance. Armed with an old hunting rifle‚ he transforms from healer to avenger in a chilling confrontation with brutality. Starring Philippe Noiret and Romy Schneider.<br/>From 22.09.2025 20:14" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Old Gun (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (22.09.2025)
