#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="636440485" tvg-name="On the verge of suicide‚ Jota witnesses a motorcycle crash and discovers the rider‚ Lisa‚ has lost her memory. Seizing the moment‚ he claims to be her longtime lover and invents a past for them both. But as they retreat to a secluded campsite called The Red Squirrel‚ cracks appear in Jota’s story‚ and Lisa may not be as lost as she seems.<br/>From 28.08.2025 11:48" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Red Squirrel (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (28.08.2025)
