#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="991716711" tvg-name="Do video games make us lonely? This is what the media often implies. And yet today‚ it's impossible to be a good MMORPG player without also beign in a team. Many games require effective cooperation to advance to the next level. So‚ are video games actually a way of improving our social skills?<br/>From 21.11.2016 15:19" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Art of Gaming - Team Spirit (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.11.2016)
