#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="2064568703" tvg-name="The production of “Shoah”‚ Claude Lanzmann's film about the holocaust released in 1985‚ was an immense undertaking and over a decade in the making. Lanzmann travelled across the world for the film to interview holocaust survivors‚ witnesses and perpetrators. This documentary traces the making of this landmark film.<br/>From 26.11.2025 21:50" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",I Had Nothing - Shoah by Claude Lanzmann (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (26.11.2025)
