#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="1886142312" tvg-name="In this painting by the American Robert Thom‚ who is the man every figure is turning to? His name is James Marion Sims‚ an American gynaecologist acclaimed by his 19th century peers who used slave women for his medical experiments.<br/>From 14.10.2024 16:14" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Anatomy of a Painting - The Gynaecologist and the Slave (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (14.10.2024)
