#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="32689997" tvg-name="Entire generations have learned about sex through mainstream porn‚ blurring the lines between personal desires and platform-driven fantasies. But if our sexuality is shaped by algorithms‚ can’t we take back some control? The post-porn movement is doing exactly that. Aimed at creating pornography that reflects honest‚ consensual sex – its creators are making waves online.<br/>From 02.01.2025 12:20" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks - Can Post-porn Awaken Our True Desires? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.01.2025)
