#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="1582857389" tvg-name="Board sports like skateboarding‚ snowboarding and surfing in Afghanistan are not just practiced for fun – they are acts of defiance. The Taliban harshly repress these activities‚ especially when they are carried out in mixed-gender groups. Tracks met with Afghan athletes who continue to resist all while inspiring their compatriots and showcasing a different imagine of their home country.<br/>From 17.06.2024 17:34" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks - Resisting the Taliban with Board Sports (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.06.2024)
