#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Environment" tvg-id="1657862615" tvg-name="The biosphere experiment set out to survive in the desert for 120 days using low-tech solutions. For food they learnt how to live off a diet of mushrooms‚ crickets‚ and to grow an ancient super food‚ Spirulina.<br/>From 23.04.2024 11:06" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Biosphere Experiment - Making of - Having Enough Food (1/5) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.04.2024)
