#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Environment" tvg-id="1196744867" tvg-name="In this episode‚ we discover with the journalist Pierre Girard how cows can make the activity of a farm more respectful of nature and how sheep can improve cereal harvests. These unusual methods could offer a solution to agriculture's carbon emissions problem.<br/>From 17.08.2022 09:36" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Roots - Climate-Killer Cows (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.08.2022)
