#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1562843999" tvg-name="Humans lie‚ deceive‚ and wage merciless wars. Sometimes it seems as if evil is typically human. On the other hand‚ humans can also be good‚ love‚ and even make peace with enemies. Which side within us is stronger? The good or the evil?<br/>From 23.07.2023 08:46" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Humanity's True Nature (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.07.2023)
