#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="739474671" tvg-name="Most people can tell quite early on whether they are attracted to women or men. But what if our desire isn't as determined as we think? Are we all perhaps bisexual?<br/>From 02.07.2023 08:37" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Are We All Bisexual? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.07.2023)
