#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1170870490" tvg-name="Since the dawn of time‚ mankind has aspired to one thing only: to go further and further beyond the limits of what he knows. But how far is it possible to travel in space? Could we reach the stars?<br/>From 10.09.2023 09:16" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Could We Reach the Stars? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (10.09.2023)
